<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Baxter cut near term.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Baxter cut near term.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Thursday it had cut Baxter International Inc's rating to near-term accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch kept Baxter as a long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Baxter closed at 43-1/8 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
